8e-5ef0-488e-9b09-207ddd1c04bf","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"上記の例のように 「const sum = (a, b) =\u0026gt; a + b」みたいなものを渡した場合はその関数が何度呼び出されるかわからないわけなので、結局、関数の実体はずっと保持し続けなきゃいけないってことになります。","ts":"1629696123.253700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dcQw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d30ecb0-4e2a-44b5-8cd7-0e34af6cfaee","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これが「絶対にコールバックとしてしか利用しないので、一度呼び出されたら消えればよい」とかなら対応できると思いますが、","ts":"1629696083.252800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3QFS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fd73852-9bbc-471d-a0bf-486f99099cf1","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"TypeScript 側に保持している「呼び出される関数の実体」はいつ削除していいかわからないですよね。","ts":"1629696057.252200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fL+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8a8b3a3-3159-4cea-ab8a-fb35e8ce64aa","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"例えば、TypeScript 側から Vim script にコールバック関数を渡したとして、Vim script 側でそれを 1 日後にコールバックする場合と、即座にコールバックする場合があるとしたら","ts":"1629696034.251800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m3c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e93a5acd-a09b-4ffe-a442-66ad267a0b40","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"リークしやすい、というか、","ts":"1629696001.251100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J+3N7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9ae22b2-3d2e-4e6e-8ec5-c7ba38f22f2b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"マジか、リークしやすいんですね","ts":"1629695658.250900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E0J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d58cb0a-7f73-49a2-b923-0981bb547236","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"TS 側で保持している関数をいつ削除するのか、とかですね。","ts":"1629693411.250700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original"