-443d-9686-8d71f611743b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"denopsだと大丈夫だろうけどMDNに注意書きがあったので一応\n\u003chttps://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function/name#javascript_compressors_and_minifiers\u003e","ts":"1629692201.248200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Function.name - JavaScript | MDN","id":1,"title":"Function.name - JavaScript | MDN","title_link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function/name#javascript_compressors_and_minifiers","text":"Function オブジェクトの name プロパティは読み取り専用で、作成時に付けられた関数の名前、もしくは無名関数の場合は anonymous または '' (空文字列) を返します。","image_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/mdn-social-share.0ca9dbda.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"developer.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://developer.mozilla.org/apple-touch-icon.0ea0fa02.png","from_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function/name#javascript_compressors_and_minifiers","original_url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/ja/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Function/name#javascript_compressors_and_minifiers"}],"edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1629692310.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QHUR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c22fc9cc-00af-4f50-ac42-448e55b4ab15","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```\u0026gt; const a = () =\u0026gt; {}\nundefined\n\u0026gt; a.name\n\"a\"```\n便利だ・・・","ts":"1629692139.247400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DZNd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e34975aa-df61-454f-97a6-831dd61e7a04","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"objectにしてkey valueの形にして登録とかの方が自然かな","ts":"1629692118.247100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"03zXk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e78fdbc4-933c-4680-b252-ffbee2eea15f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"その場で束縛したら `sum.name` で取れるっぽい","ts":"1629692109.246800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MM1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"449cfa01-b7b2-485b-8379-c8247b52f1fa","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"JSって\n```const sum = (a, b) =\u0026gt; {\n  return a + b\n}\n\nconsole.log(sum.varName)```\n的なので関数の変数名自体って取ったりする方法ありましたっけ","ts":"1629692063.246300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bWJH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0829a907-a4ea-4078-9b3a-73c5ed949b40","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どうにかして透過的な層を自作するしかなさそう？","ts":"1629692055.246100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0zw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a3d3acf-c3dc-47e7-9032-1a4b97ac2afd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"透過的に\n```function! dps_sum(a, b, sum) abort\n  return a:sum(a:a, a:b)\nendfunction```\nみたいにしたかった（fzfはcallbackにVim scriptレベルのfuncrefを渡す必要があるのでちょっと手間）","ts":"1629691852.244600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tek"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1a483d0-b837-4053-92db-08bb04058959","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1629691794.243700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wLP6a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62254970-f095-4215-842a-780f4999ea83","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、ですよね","ts":"1629691787.243500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6/h7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"221c1d4e-0066-48c4-864d-daf1bf3bfbc6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"TS側の関数か、よく見てなかった(hrsh7thさんが書いてる方法で行けますね)","ts":"1629691757.243300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AO9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8b0a300-5a55-4d4c-9e17-51e7afd1657d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"それができないので上記のように変換してくださいというニュアンスですね。","ts":"1629691684.242800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hxOd/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16f41f86-0215-4300-b10e-4481488ea3ef","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```const sum = (a: number, b: number) =\u0026gt; {\n  return a + b\n}\n\nvim.call(\"dps_sum\", { a: 1, b: 2, sum })```\nこれでdps_sum内で受け取った関数をfuncrefとして評価ってできます？","ts":"1629691630.242300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Mo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a0639b5-790f-4f2b-b993-04bcc6a177ff","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"### TS -\u0026gt; Vim script\n• 渡したいコールバックを \u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/deno-denops-std/tree/main/denops_std/anonymous\u003e を使って変換して、 Vim script 側に渡す\n• Vim script ではコールバックしたいタイミングで `denops#{request,notify}(...)` を実行する","ts":"1629691269.241400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pJOl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9f820b7-c35b-468d-9c5c-de7e313a0125","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"このへんだったかな","ts":"1629691094.239500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CvgD"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *denops#callback#add()*\ndenops#callback#add({callback}[, {options}])\n        Add {callback} to internal callback map as an anonymous function and\n        return an unique {id} to call the {callback} later.\n        The following attributes are available on {options}.\n \n        \"once\"          |v:true| to add the callback as a one-time anonymous\n                        function which will be removed when the callback has\n                        called. It is a default behavior due to backward\n                        compatibility. Use |v:false| to make the callback\n                        persistent.\n \n        \" One-time callback\n        let id = denops#call#add({ a, b -\u0026gt; a + b })\n        let ret = denops#callback#call(id, 1, 2)\n \n        \" Persistent callback\n        let id = denops#call#add({ a, b -\u0026gt; a + b }, { 'once': v:false })\n        let ret1 = denops#callback#call(id, 1, 2)\n        let ret2 = denops#callback#call(id, 2, 3)\n```","ts":"1629691091.239300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"cf336e34-2ec7-4435-bda5-8b762b532b89","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h denops#callback#add()","ts":"1629691091.239200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xCn4S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"095ca7da-a61d-437e-b4fa-65eb26b487b8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"fzf-previewは全ての関数をfuncrefじゃなくてコマンド or 関数としてVim側に登録して叩いてるんですよね","ts":"1629690981.238700","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1629690998.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3DEg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0d15724-75f9-49fa-9414-9c947328092f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"神・・・","ts":"1629690940.237900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6kz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bc2578c-c576-4d7a-92bc-d2feeaa025dd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"行けたはず","ts":"1629690930.237700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xaoQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a426dc7-48ed-4364-8375-1ad064ff3c4f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"具体的にはTSレベルで実装した関数をVim scriptにfuncrefとして渡せるか的な","ts":"1629690882.237500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original"